; WBGapTest.script: amicradle-teams designs/OPENBENCH-GAPS-20261112.md's automatic rows, in a lab, on
; GFOpenBench and on OS 3.2.3's Workbench alike. Needs WBGapTest, WBGapRexx.rexx and DragTest in SYS:T/WBGap
; (from build.sh's out dir). It prints PASS, FAIL, SKIP and INFO lines, and saves them to RAM:wbgap-results.
; Then: WBGapTest STARTUP SETUP has been run here, so the WBStartup rows need a reboot and
; "SYS:T/WBGap/WBGapTest STARTUP CHECK" after it.
; MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 AmiCradle Team.
FailAt 21
CD SYS:T/WBGap
Echo "INFO WBGapTest run on" NOLINE
Version workbench.library
WBGapTest MENUS DUMP >RAM:wbgap-menus
WBGapTest MENUS >RAM:wbgap-results
WBGapTest SETUP >>RAM:wbgap-results
WBGapTest API >>RAM:wbgap-results
WBGapTest NOTIFY >>RAM:wbgap-results
If NOT EXISTS SYS:Rexxc/rx
  Echo "SKIP R1 no rx" >>RAM:wbgap-results
  Echo "SKIP R2 no rx" >>RAM:wbgap-results
  Echo "SKIP R1b no rx" >>RAM:wbgap-results
  Echo "SKIP R2b no rx" >>RAM:wbgap-results
Else
  Run >NIL: SYS:System/RexxMast >NIL:
  Wait 1
  SYS:Rexxc/rx SYS:T/WBGap/WBGapRexx.rexx >>RAM:wbgap-results
  SYS:Rexxc/rx SYS:T/WBGap/WBGapRexx.rexx OPENBENCH >>RAM:wbgap-results
  SYS:Rexxc/rx SYS:T/WBGap/WBGapX4.rexx >>RAM:wbgap-results
EndIf
WBGapTest SCREENS >>RAM:wbgap-results
WBGapTest BIG >>RAM:wbgap-results
Copy WBGapTest SYS:WBStartup/WBGapA QUIET
Copy WBGapTest SYS:WBStartup/WBGapB QUIET
Copy WBGapTest SYS:WBStartup/WBGapC QUIET
WBGapTest STARTUP SETUP >>RAM:wbgap-results
Type RAM:wbgap-results
Copy RAM:wbgap-results RAM:wbgap-menus SYS:T/WBGap/ QUIET
